ater reuse of the same key carries no stale memberships.\n- **FR-008** (R02): `get(key)` on a hit MUST refresh that entry's LRU recency.\n- **FR-009** (R02): `len(cache)` MUST count live entries and MUST never exceed\n  `maxsize`.\n- **FR-010** (R02 extension, Claim-A, variant `put_no_recency_refresh`,\n  2026-09-21): Overwriting an existing key via `put` MUST refresh its LRU\n  recency, making it the most-recently-used entry.\n"}